   "title": "STRENGTHS",
   "intro": "",
   "items": [
    {
     "title": "STARBOARD SIDE ACCESS GATE",
     "text": "The side access gate makes it easier to dock, haul in and release fish."
    },
    {
     "title": "EVERYTHING FOR FISHING",
     "text": "Fully equipped fishing station, places to store lures and hooks, water circulation live bait well, rod holders, cup holders, chopping board, etc. The Antares 7 Fishing has everything you need to enjoy memorable fishing trips. On top of this equipment, you can have the option of an additional 9-inch display connected to the sounder, 5 additional rod holders on the hard top and a spotlight."
    },
    {
     "title": "COMFORTABLE SALOON",
     "text": "Modularity is improved by a pivoting driver’s seat and a co-driver’s bench seat that flips round in no time, so that you can create a facing area with the second bench seat or a berth.\nBehind the driver's seat, there is a galley with a sink and storage space that you can also customise with the following options: a 42 L fridge, a gas or an electric hob."
    }
   ],
